Marginalia is the cosmetic hand surrounding completed workings after Arcane 15.
It does not change damage, cost, timing, permissions, or rune behavior.

Continued study opens:

  Unadorned          immediately
  Silverline          5,000 long-study GXP
  Ember Script       15,000 long-study GXP
  Aurora Hand        35,000 long-study GXP
  Void Palimpsest    75,000 long-study GXP

Use "marginalia" to review the illuminated index and
"marginalia <style>" to select an open hand.
